Test fixture for the header-injector exemption test suite.

This file's name (LICENSE, no extension) resolves to the `exempt`
variant family at the injector's variant_family_for() resolver: the
basename does not appear in BASENAME_VARIANT and there is no suffix to
look up in SUFFIX_VARIANT, so the injector returns VARIANT_EXEMPT and
treats the file as not-applicable. The file therefore needs no banner
of its own; injecting one would be a category error per the spec's
LICENSE-exemption rule.

Copyright text: Copyright (c) Ahmed G. Gad — present here so the
license-author-consistency check (a downstream validator) can verify
the LICENSE's copyright holder agrees with the canonical banner's
author identity, even though this LICENSE is exempt from the banner
itself.
